The film is a sequel to the 2020 film Stargirl, which was in turn based on Jerry Spinelli's 2000
novel of the same name; it is not an adaptation of the novel's sequel Love, Stargirl.

12
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The story follows Stargirl and her mother Ana, who is hired as the costume designer on a movie, as they relocate to Los
Angeles, where Stargirl meets new friends and explores her creative side, gaining success as a performer.

13
